        <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">DO NOT ENABLE THIS ELEMENT
                    THIS IS USED FOR THE DOCUMENTATION ONLY

                    Abbreviations:
                    UDV : User Defined Variabled
                    JM : JMeter
                    UP : User parameters
                    POP : Post processor
                    PRP : Pre-processor
                    DPOP : Debug post processor

                    TODO
                    1. Adding multiple tags. What is the maxmim number of tags?
                    2. Search with different text. Repeating the serach
                    3. Simulating scrollng in the list
                    4. Payment method selection. How to implement the weightage from available values?
                    5. Compare the response times in JM with Web interface
                    6. Randomize the /Tag/Find ASC/DSC. What kind of parametrization is required in Tag/Find ? List of
                    categories
                    7. Additional header should be included. What is the effect of additional headers ?
                    8. Think time should be incorporated
                    9. Find the impact of the connect time to the test results
                    10. HTTP Request OPTIONS are not required ?
                    11. Importantace of x-correlation-id
                    12. Check the order of execution of first two request (sequentially or parallel)
                    13.


                </stringProp>
